LICENCE NOT CONFIRMED

The supplied file (_originals/resume-template-2.tex) contains no author or licence.
This template is integrated and tested, but registry.json keeps
license.commercialUseReviewed = false, so it is NOT offered to students and the
worker refuses to compile it for them.

To enable it: find the template's original source (e.g. its Overleaf gallery page),
confirm its licence allows commercial use inside Skill Guru, replace this file with
that licence text, and set commercialUseReviewed = true in registry.json.
